# Paths no build or test reads. A PR whose changed files all match this list is docs-only: the
# "PR check" job lints it and passes, and Xcode Cloud's PR workflow does not start a run for it.
# Anything not listed counts as app code, so a new path errs toward testing.
#
# Two readers, one meaning, which is Xcode Cloud's (docs/pr-check.md):
#   folder/       every file in that folder, at any depth
#   name          a file with that name, in any folder
#   folder/name   that file in that folder
# scripts/pr-check.sh reads this file, as main has it, never a PR's copy. Xcode Cloud keeps a
# copy in the PR workflow's start condition (Files and Folders); `scripts/pr-check.sh
# xcode-cloud` prints it for the API. Change both together.
#
# Not listed, since Xcode Cloud runs them before it builds: ci_scripts/, Brewfile,
# scripts/lint.sh, scripts/common.sh, scripts/check-us-english.sh, .swiftformat, .swiftlint.yml.
# Not listed, and never no-code whatever this file says, since they decide the check: this file,
# scripts/pr-check.sh, and .github/workflows/.
